::  name       mantra diff fields equality gate
::  shape      count - int (@u32) -> lawful - int (@u32)
::  invariant  answers 1 exactly when count is diff fields=2; answers 0 otherwise
::  example    2 -> 1 · 1 -> 0 · 3 -> 0
::  readers    Mantra · Glow Tend a1 unfinished · Ashvini
::  nib        equinox-e258-equality-seventh-v0 · STOA337
::
::  Ashvini equality · seventh pedestal gth cannot speak. The sur shape names
::  a Diff's two fields (inserts · deletes); this gate decides *exactly*,
::  not by a ceiling.
|=  sample=@u32
?:  (eq sample 2)  1  0
